WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.800
Hi, friends! I'm Bop.

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.080
Stomp with me!

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.200
Right, left!

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:18.780
Now sway, sway, like a gentle tree.

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:21.540
One, two! Your turn!

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:30.180
Stomp and sway! Great job!

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:33.840
Freeze... you did it!
